# Victor's global Codex instructions

Keep this file small and import the installed engineering standards and routing rules:

```text
@/absolute/path/to/.codex/ENGINEERING_STANDARDS.md
@/absolute/path/to/.codex/SUBAGENT_ROUTING.md
```

`install.sh` writes both correct absolute paths in a managed block in
`$CODEX_HOME/AGENTS.md`; this template is provided for manual setups.
